  \item \textbf{Failure Conditions ($\mathcal{C}_{\text{failure}}$):}
  \begin{enumerate}
    \item Simultaneous exhaustion of both primary PostgreSQL storage and durable RabbitMQ disk persistence.
    \item Malformed webhook payload lacking mandatory SKU or channel signature fields (routed safely to Dead-Letter Queue without corrupting ledger state).
  \end{enumerate}
\end{itemize}

