  \item \textit{Do end-users have realistic expectations?} — Yes, human-in-the-loop approval ensures transparent control over buffer changes.
  \item \textit{Does the team have the right mix of skills?} — Yes, covering Node.js, Python, SQL, Redis/RabbitMQ, and Web UI.
