\section{Data Model and Description}
\subsection{Data Description}
Unlike conventional CRUD inventory tools that overwrite a single \texttt{stock\_count} column, our data model centers on an immutable event store in PostgreSQL complemented by materialized read projections for fast dashboard queries.

\subsection{Data objects and Relationships}
The four core relational entities in PostgreSQL are:
\begin{enumerate}
  \item \textbf{\texttt{inventory\_events} (Immutable Append-Only Ledger):}
  \begin{itemize}
    \item \texttt{event\_id} (\texttt{VARCHAR(64) PRIMARY KEY}) — Unique idempotency key from channel.
    \item \texttt{sku\_id} (\texttt{VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL}) — Product identifier.
    \item \texttt{channel\_id} (\texttt{VARCHAR(24) NOT NULL}) — \texttt{AMAZON}, \texttt{FLIPKART}, \texttt{WEBSITE}, or \texttt{POS}.
    \item \texttt{event\_type} (\texttt{VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL}) — \texttt{SALE}, \texttt{RETURN}, \texttt{RESTOCK}, \texttt{CANCEL}, \texttt{UNWIND}.
    \item \texttt{delta\_qty} (\texttt{INTEGER NOT NULL}) — Signed stock change ($-1, +10$, etc.).
    \item \texttt{order\_id} (\texttt{VARCHAR(64)}), \texttt{customer\_id} (\texttt{VARCHAR(64)}), \texttt{net\_margin} (\texttt{NUMERIC(10,2)}).
    \item \texttt{created\_at} (\texttt{TIMESTAMPTZ DEFAULT NOW()}).
  \end{itemize}
  \item \textbf{\texttt{sku\_projections} (Materialized Stock \& Buffer View):}
  \begin{itemize}
    \item \texttt{sku\_id} (\texttt{PRIMARY KEY}), \texttt{physical\_stock} (\texttt{INTEGER}), \texttt{channel\_buffers} (\texttt{JSONB}), \texttt{last\_event\_id} (\texttt{VARCHAR(64)}), \texttt{version} (\texttt{BIGINT}).
  \end{itemize}
  \item \textbf{\texttt{conflict\_audit\_log} (Conflict Resolution History):}
  \begin{itemize}
    \item \texttt{conflict\_id} (\texttt{UUID PRIMARY KEY}), \texttt{sku\_id}, \texttt{winning\_order\_id}, \texttt{unwound\_order\_id}, \texttt{winning\_channel}, \texttt{unwound\_channel}, \texttt{margin\_saved} (\texttt{NUMERIC(10,2)}), \texttt{resolution\_reason} (\texttt{TEXT}), \texttt{resolved\_at} (\texttt{TIMESTAMPTZ}).
  \end{itemize}
  \item \textbf{\texttt{buffer\_recommendations} (Human-in-the-Loop Advisor Table):}
  \begin{itemize}
    \item \texttt{rec\_id} (\texttt{UUID PRIMARY KEY}), \texttt{sku\_id}, \texttt{target\_channel}, \texttt{conflict\_count\_30d} (\texttt{INTEGER}), \texttt{suggested\_buffer\_units} (\texttt{INTEGER}), \texttt{evidence\_summary} (\texttt{TEXT}), \texttt{status} (\texttt{PENDING}, \texttt{APPROVED}, \texttt{REJECTED}), \texttt{reviewed\_by} (\texttt{VARCHAR(64)}), \texttt{reviewed\_at} (\texttt{TIMESTAMPTZ}).
