    \item \textit{Auditability \& Explainability:} $100\%$ of stock changes and conflict unwinds are permanently traceable in PostgreSQL.
    \item \textit{Accountability (Human-in-the-Loop):} Zero autonomous policy mutations; every buffer recommendation requires explicit seller approval.
